lz-disk-cleaner (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Features:
    - Disk usage analysis with visual pie charts
    - System cache and temporary file cleaning
    - APT package cache cleaning
    - Linglong application management and uninstall
    - System log cleanup (system logs, journal logs, crash reports)
    - File shredder with secure multi-pass deletion
    - System slimming and optimization
    - Real-time resource monitoring (CPU, Memory, Network)
    - Support for stubborn file deletion with privilege elevation
    - Dark/Light theme support
    - Chinese localization

